        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>17\" Store Front  Door Extension Flush Bolt</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese 17\" extension flush door bolts are for aluminum store front doors. Template Size 15\" - Rod 16\" with 1/8\" offset. Available  Aluminum or Duro (Dark Bronze) finish colors. Comes complete with flush bolt assembly, extension rod and guide plate.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFlush bolts (also know as door edge bolts) are installed into the edge of the door and have a toggle lever that is moved up and down to push the attached rod and bolt into a header or threshold (footer), which locks or unlocks an inactive door.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/standard-store-front-door-flush-bolt-global-th1100-fb1\"><b>Standard 12\" Flush Bolt</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/12-inch-store-front-door-flush-bolt-global-th1100-fb3\"><b>12\" with 1/4\" Offset Flush Bolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FB2-size.jpg?v=1704354742\" width=\"525\" height=\"525\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Global TH1100-FB2 Flush Bolt Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Global TH1100-FB2 Flush Bolt\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Flush Bolt Length: 17\"</li>\r\n<li>Rod Length: 16\" (1/4\"-20 thread rod)</li>\r\n<li>Offset: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Spring loaded lever action</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with nylon keeper (guide plate) and fasteners</li>\r\n<li>Square nylon tip with Beveled Corners Fits in 1/2\" (13 mm) Square or Round Strike</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>5/8\" adjustment on rod length</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate: 15/16\" Wide x 4-1/4\" High with 5/32\" radius corner</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Holes: 5-7/32\" Center to Center</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
