                "description": "Global TH1100-FB2 flush bolt - These 17 inch extension flush bolts are normally used on for metal frame store front doors. Template Size 15 - Rod 16 inches with 1/8 inch offset. Available  Aluminum or Duro (Dark Bronze) finish colors.",
